<title>ITALY: Turin airport reopens after plane crash.</title>
<headline>Turin airport reopens after plane crash.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turin's Caselle airport has reopened after an Antonov-124 cargo plane crashed while attempting to land earlier on Tuesday killing at least three people.</p>
<p>An airport official said the situation was &quot;returning to normal&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392- 66129589</p>
